<title>SINGAPORE: Transmarco suspended pending statement.</title>
<headline>Transmarco suspended pending statement.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading and telecommunication stock Transmarco requested that trading of its shares be suspended on Monday afternoon pending an announcement.</p>
<p>Dealers said the shares jumped sharply just before the noon close to Singapore $10.70, up S$1.30. Volume was 1.4 million shares.  </p>
<p>Indonesian tobacco tycoon Putera Sampoerna raised his bid for Transmarco to S$8.55 per share last Tuesday from S$6.50 per share.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
